1 एव॑ adv. so, even so;
 certainly, really;
 even, just,
exactly, emphasizing the prec. word or only expl., often connected with
a pron. or another adv., e.g. स एव, एतदेव, इत्येव, तथैव, नैव,
चैव;
 एव च, एव वा, etc.

2 ए॑व a. speedy, quick;
 m. (mostly pl.) course, way, custom,
manner, use.

एवा॑ adv. so, even so;
 certainly, really;
 even, just,
exactly, emphasizing the prec. word or only expl., often connected with
a pron. or another adv., e.g. स एव, एतदेव, इत्येव, तथैव, नैव,
चैव;
 एव च, एव वा, etc.

एवंगत a. so circumstanced or situated, such;
 loc.
under such circumstances.
